  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.1",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τὸ λοιπὸν προσεύχεσθε, ἀδελφοί, περὶ ἡμῶν, ἵνα ὁ λόγος τοῦ κυρίου τρέχῃ καὶ δοξάζηται καθὼς καὶ πρὸς ὑμᾶς,",
    "chunk_index": 29,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.2",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ ἵνα ῥυσθῶμεν ἀπὸ τῶν ἀτόπων καὶ πονηρῶν ἀνθρώπων, οὐ γὰρ πάντων ἡ πίστις.",
    "chunk_index": 30,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.3",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Πιστὸς δέ ἐστιν ὁ κύριος, ὃς στηρίξει ὑμᾶς καὶ φυλάξει ἀπὸ τοῦ πονηροῦ.",
    "chunk_index": 31,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.4",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "πεποίθαμεν δὲ ἐν κυρίῳ ἐφʼ ὑμᾶς, ὅτι ἃ παραγγέλλομεν [καὶ] ποιεῖτε καὶ ποιήσετε.",
    "chunk_index": 32,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.5",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.5",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ὁ δὲ κύριος κατευθύναι ὑμῶν τὰς καρδίας εἰς τὴν ἀγάπην τοῦ θεοῦ καὶ εἰς τὴν ὑπομονὴν τοῦ χριστοῦ.",
    "chunk_index": 33,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.6",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.6",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Παραγγέλλομεν δὲ ὑμῖν, ἀδελφοί, ἐν ὀνόματι τοῦ κυρίου Ἰησοῦ Χριστοῦ στέλλεσθαι ὑμᾶς ἀπὸ παντὸς ἀδελφοῦ ἀτάκτως περιπατοῦντος καὶ μὴ κατὰ τὴν παρά δοσιν ἣν παρελάβετε παρʼ ἡμῶν.",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.7",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.7",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "αὐτοὶ γὰρ οἴδατε πῶς δεῖ μιμεῖσθαι ἡμᾶς, ὅτι οὐκ ἠτακτήσαμεν ἐν ὑμῖν οὐδὲ δωρεὰν ἄρτον ἐφάγομεν παρά τινος,",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.8",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.8",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἀλλʼ ἐν κόπῳ καὶ μόχθῳ νυκτὸς καὶ ἡμέρας ἐργαζόμενοι πρὸς τὸ μὴ",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.9",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.9",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐπιβαρῆσαί τινα ὑμῶν· οὐχ ὅτι οὐκ ἔχομεν ἐξουσίαν, ἀλλʼ ἵνα ἑαυτοὺς τύπον δῶμεν ὑμῖν εἰς τὸ μιμεῖσθαι ἡμᾶς.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.10",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.10",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ γὰρ ὅτε ἦμεν πρὸς ὑμᾶς, τοῦτο παρηγγέλλομεν ὑμῖν, ὅτι εἴ τις οὐ θέλει ἐργάζεσθαι μηδὲ ἐσθιέτω.",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.11",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.11",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἀκούομεν γάρ τινας περιπατοῦντας ἐν ὑμῖν ἀτάκτως, μηδὲν ἐργαζομένους ἀλλὰ περιεργαζομένους·",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.12",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.12",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τοῖς δὲ τοιούτοις παραγγέλλομεν καὶ παρακαλοῦμεν ἐν κυρίῳ Ἰησοῦ Χριστῷ ἵνα μετὰ ἡσυχίας ἐργαζόμενοι τὸν ἑαυτῶν ἄρτον ἐσθίωσιν.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.13",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.13",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ὑμεῖς δέ, ἀδελφοί, μὴ ἐνκακήσητε καλοποιοῦντες.",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.14",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.14",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "εἰ δέ τις οὐχ ὑπακούει τῷ λόγῳ ἡμῶν διὰ τῆς ἐπιστολῆς, τοῦτον σημειοῦσθε, μὴ συναναμίγιυσθαι αὐτῷ, ἵνα ἐντραπῇ·",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.15",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.15",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ μὴ ὡς ἐχθρὸν ἡγεῖσθε, ἀλλὰ νουθετεῖτε ὡς ἀδελφόν.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.16",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.16",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Αὐτὸς δὲ ὁ κύριος τῆς εἰρήνης δῴη ὑμῖν τὴν εἰρήνην διὰ παντὸς ἐν παντὶ τρόπῳ. ὁ κύριος μετὰ πάντων ὑμὼν.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.17",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.17",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Ὁ ἀσπασμὸς τῇ ἐμῇ χειρὶ Παύλου, ὅ ἐστιν σημεῖον ἐν πάσῃ ἐπιστολῇ· οὕτως γράφω.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2#tlg0031.tlg014.3.18",
    "work_id": "perseus/tlg0031/tlg014/perseus-grc2",
    "canonical_ref": "tlg0031.tlg014.3.18",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἡ χάρις τοῦ κυρίου ἡμῶν Ἰησοῦ Χριστοῦ μετα πάντων ὑμῶν.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
